<!--
  German interface strings.

  Keys are grouped by where they appear. Every key must also exist in
  UiStrings.en.xaml — a missing one shows up as the bare key in the window
  rather than as a crash, which is deliberate but still a defect.

  Not in here: the strings the model produces (folder names, descriptions).
  Those follow AppSettings.OutputLanguage, not the interface language, and live
  in Core/Llm/GermanPrompts.cs.
-->
